    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World of Warships: Legends</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World of Warships: Legends is a free-to-play online naval shooter you can play across Steam, consoles, and mobile devices. Jump into dynamic battles aboard legendary 20th-century warships and enjoy fast-paced combat with smooth, intuitive controls!\u00a0<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964090/extras/1bb455b7991d0923322978fc62cbd6ef.poster.avif?t=1753796847\" width=596 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964090/extras/1bb455b7991d0923322978fc62cbd6ef.webm?t=1753796847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964090/extras/1bb455b7991d0923322978fc62cbd6ef.mp4?t=1753796847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Cross-Platform</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with your friends on PC, console, phone, or tablet. Dive into epic team battles and rule the seas together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessible, Easy-to-Learn, and Rewarding Online Action</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy smooth, controller-friendly gameplay, fine-tuned for the PC version. It\u2019s easy to pick up\u2014but challenging enough to keep you coming back for more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964090/extras/cc9555dc6a6ec754b939e0858219f356.poster.avif?t=1753796847\" width=596 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964090/extras/cc9555dc6a6ec754b939e0858219f356.webm?t=1753796847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964090/extras/cc9555dc6a6ec754b939e0858219f356.mp4?t=1753796847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Unique Commanders System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect over 100 commanders with historical and fictional backgrounds. Level them up and create unique builds to match your battle strategy.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Regular Updates</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get regular free updates and explore fresh content, new campaigns, special events, and exciting collaborations.\u00a0<br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964090/extras/fa625468f1d310778c82b44d8138572b.poster.avif?t=1753796847\" width=596 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964090/extras/fa625468f1d310778c82b44d8138572b.webm?t=1753796847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964090/extras/fa625468f1d310778c82b44d8138572b.mp4?t=1753796847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast, Action-Packed Battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on thrilling sea battles against real players or bots. Enjoy quick, action-packed matches or try out other game modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Legendary Warships</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the helm of over 500 historical warships from the 20th century's most powerful navies, including the USA, USSR, UK, Germany, and Japan.\u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964090/extras/752bccf8d1a7fc8a01ac172baa4d19fa.poster.avif?t=1753796847\" width=596 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964090/extras/752bccf8d1a7fc8a01ac172baa4d19fa.webm?t=1753796847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964090/extras/752bccf8d1a7fc8a01ac172baa4d19fa.mp4?t=1753796847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World of Warships: Legends</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World of Warships: Legends is a free-to-play online naval shooter you can play across Steam, consoles, and mobile devices. Jump into dynamic battles aboard legendary 20th-century warships and enjoy fast-paced combat with smooth, intuitive controls!\u00a0<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964090/extras/1bb455b7991d0923322978fc62cbd6ef.poster.avif?t=1753796847\" width=596 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964090/extras/1bb455b7991d0923322978fc62cbd6ef.webm?t=1753796847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964090/extras/1bb455b7991d0923322978fc62cbd6ef.mp4?t=1753796847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Cross-Platform</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with your friends on PC, console, phone, or tablet. Dive into epic team battles and rule the seas together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessible, Easy-to-Learn, and Rewarding Online Action</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy smooth, controller-friendly gameplay, fine-tuned for the PC version. It\u2019s easy to pick up\u2014but challenging enough to keep you coming back for more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964090/extras/cc9555dc6a6ec754b939e0858219f356.poster.avif?t=1753796847\" width=596 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964090/extras/cc9555dc6a6ec754b939e0858219f356.webm?t=1753796847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964090/extras/cc9555dc6a6ec754b939e0858219f356.mp4?t=1753796847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Unique Commanders System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect over 100 commanders with historical and fictional backgrounds. Level them up and create unique builds to match your battle strategy.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Regular Updates</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get regular free updates and explore fresh content, new campaigns, special events, and exciting collaborations.\u00a0<br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964090/extras/fa625468f1d310778c82b44d8138572b.poster.avif?t=1753796847\" width=596 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964090/extras/fa625468f1d310778c82b44d8138572b.webm?t=1753796847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964090/extras/fa625468f1d310778c82b44d8138572b.mp4?t=1753796847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast, Action-Packed Battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on thrilling sea battles against real players or bots. Enjoy quick, action-packed matches or try out other game modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Legendary Warships</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the helm of over 500 historical warships from the 20th century's most powerful navies, including the USA, USSR, UK, Germany, and Japan.\u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964090/extras/752bccf8d1a7fc8a01ac172baa4d19fa.poster.avif?t=1753796847\" width=596 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964090/extras/752bccf8d1a7fc8a01ac172baa4d19fa.webm?t=1753796847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964090/extras/752bccf8d1a7fc8a01ac172baa4d19fa.mp4?t=1753796847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Join this free-to-play PvP online naval shooter with fast-paced combat, easy-to-learn gameplay, intuitive controls, and cross-platform play on Steam, console, and mobile. Choose from 500+ warships and 100+ Commanders, and master tactics on diverse maps. Play now and become a legend!",
